  "instance_name": "mapping_001",
  "label": "The man is mapped as the requester of a meme explanation",
  "description": "The text 'yea, if you could go ahead and explain memes that'd be great!' is overlaid on the image of the man. The visual material (the man in formal attire speaking) is mapped onto the textual material (the request for an explanation of memes), implying that the man represents the person making the request. This is a common meme trope where the visual subject is identified as the entity performing the action described in the text. The man's earnest expression and formal setting contrast humorously with the casual, internet-savvy request, reinforcing the mapping.",
